<title>NETHERLANDS: Bangert raises Ahrend to Buy.</title>
<headline>Bangert raises Ahrend to Buy.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of March 13 research.</p>
<p>    Company---------Sector--------Price---Broker----------------</p>
<p>    Ahrend	    Office equip. 111.90  Bangert Pontier</p>
<p>COMMENT: Buy. Believe margin improvement will continue, though at a slower pace. Sales targets for year 2000 mean acquisitions likely, probably in Germany. EPS expectations must be lowered accordingly. But company still undervalued compared to market and current discount not justified.</p>
<p>    Estimates (NLG):  EPS     pvs EPS   P/E    Dividend</p>
<p>    1996 (actual)     5.42		  13.4   1.90</p>
<p>    1997		  6.80    7.20	16.5   2.40</p>
<p>    1998		  8.05    8.20	13.9   2.80</p>
